  "description": "Analog Devices (Maxim) MAX17048 ModelGauge fuel gauge for one Li-ion/LiPo cell in the 8-pin 2 x 2 mm TDFN-EP: powered from and measuring the cell on VDD (2.5-4.5 V), no sense resistor, +-7.5 mV/cell voltage measurement, state of charge and charge rate over I2C at fixed address 0x36 (400 kHz), open-drain ALRT output, 23 uA active / 3 uA hibernate.",
