      "traits": [
        {
          "params": {
            "note": "Slave only. 7-bit address 0b0110110 (0x36), fixed: 0x6C write / 0x6D read. fSCL 0-400 kHz, bus capacitance <= 400 pF, SCL/SDA input capacitance 60 pF. VIH >= 1.4 V, VIL <= 0.5 V, SDA VOL <= 0.4 V at 4 mA; SDA, SCL -0.3 to +5.5 V whatever VDD is. The system provides the pull-ups. Registers are 16-bit words; 8-bit writes have no effect.",
